Color\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eContinue back through the surrounding villages, connecting the rural terrace landscape with Ubud’s cultural center.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003carticle class=\"stop \"\u003e\u003ctime\u003e\u003c/time\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003ccircle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M7 6v7m3-7v7m-3 0h3m-1.5 0v5M16 6v12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMakan di warung lokal sekitar Ubud, Bali, Indonesia\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePause for a local meal that introduces Balinese flavors and provides a grounded way to reflect on the morning’s agricultural and cultural context.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/article\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/main\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e",
